-- | Test ReleaseFromTicket rejects tickets where a verified CCV instance owner
-- is not part of the ticket signatory set.
testReleaseFromTicketRejectsVerifiedCCVOwnerNotSignatory : Script ()
testReleaseFromTicketRejectsVerifiedCCVOwnerNotSignatory = script do
